---
// Apple App Store support URL for the Count Yourself Skinny iPhone app. noindex, not linked from nav.
// Contact: support@my4mlife.com (the sitewide support address); privacy questions go to privacy@my4mlife.com.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Count Yourself Skinny Support | My4MLife';
const description = 'Support and answers for the Count Yourself Skinny iPhone app from My4MLife.';
const canonical = 'https://www.my4mlife.com/legal/count-yourself-skinny-support';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots="noindex,follow">
  <section class="legal-doc">
    <div class="legal-wrap">
      <h1>Count Yourself Skinny Support</h1>
      <div class="legal-body">
        <p>Count Yourself Skinny is an iPhone app from My4MLife. It helps you count a few simple things instead of calories: chews per bite, hours between meals, steps and more. With compatible AirPods, it counts your chews for you.</p>

        <h4>Contact us</h4>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@my4mlife.com">support@my4mlife.com</a>. Tell us your iPhone model, your iOS version and what happened. Please don't send health details. For privacy questions, write to <a href="mailto:privacy@my4mlife.com">privacy@my4mlife.com</a>.</p>

        <h4>Which AirPods work?</h4>
        <p>AirPods Pro, AirPods (3rd generation) or later, and AirPods Max. Other earbuds can't count chews.</p>

        <h4>I don't have AirPods. Can I still use the app?</h4>
        <p>Yes. The Bite Pacer is free and doesn't need AirPods. It counts to 32 with a buzz so you can pace each bite yourself.</p>

        <h4>How do I cancel my subscription?</h4>
        <p>Apple manages subscriptions, so we can't cancel them for you. On your iPhone, open Settings, tap your name, tap Subscriptions, choose Count Yourself Skinny, then tap Cancel Subscription. You can also tap Manage Subscription on the About screen inside the app. You keep Pro until the end of the period you already paid for.</p>

        <h4>How do I restore my purchase?</h4>
        <p>Open the app, go to About, and tap Restore Purchases. Sign in with the same Apple ID you used to buy. If it still doesn't work, email us.</p>

        <h4>Where is my data?</h4>
        <p>Your counts, streak, meals and weigh-ins stay on your phone. There is no account. Read the full <a href="/legal/count-yourself-skinny-privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>

        <h4>Terms</h4>
        <p>The app is licensed under Apple's standard <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" rel="noopener">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a>.</p>

        <h4>Good to know</h4>
        <p>Count Yourself Skinny is an educational tool. It isn't medical advice and doesn't diagnose or treat anything. Talk to your own physician before changing how you eat or fast, especially if you're pregnant, have diabetes, take medication, or have a history of disordered eating.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-doc { padding: 7rem 1rem 4rem; }
  .legal-wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; }
  .legal-wrap h1 { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .legal-body :global(h4) { margin: 1.75rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .legal-body :global(p) { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
</style>
